  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat (400°F).",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together olive oil, lemon juice, garlic, Syrian spices, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add lamb cubes to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
